@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Human skill metadata; supply authentication through your HTTP client's secret environment.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/skills/commands
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expand only. No gathering, inference or delegation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/skills/expand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"standard/risk-check","input":"Review the proposed change.","arguments":[]}

### Unknown skill returns 404.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/skills/expand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"missing-skill"}